/T (Input validation note: this version allows a lower current reading only for the exact 65535-to-0 rollover specified in the assignment. If the real meter can roll over and show a non-zero current reading, the condition can be broadened to accept any decrease as a rollover, but that can also hide a data-entry mistake. A production system should store a rollover counter or meter event flag.)
/E (Input validation note: this version allows a lower current reading only for the exact 65535-to-0 rollover specified in the assignment. If the real meter can roll over and show a non-zero current reading, the condition can be broadened to accept any decrease as a rollover, but that can also hide a data-entry mistake. A production system should store a rollover counter or meter event flag.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [74]
>>
