/T (Alternative design: store slab limits and rates in arrays, then loop through the slabs instead of writing separate if-statements. For s slabs, the calculation takes O\(s\) time and O\(s\) extra space for the arrays. With a fixed three-slab tariff, the current if-statement design takes O\(1\) time and O\(1\) extra space.)
/E (Alternative design: store slab limits and rates in arrays, then loop through the slabs instead of writing separate if-statements. For s slabs, the calculation takes O\(s\) time and O\(s\) extra space for the arrays. With a fixed three-slab tariff, the current if-statement design takes O\(1\) time and O\(1\) extra space.)
