<<
/Title (Trade-off: reading a configuration file adds a small startup cost and error-handling code, but avoids recompiling and redistributing the program for each tariff revision. For a district system, this is preferable to hard-coded rates. The billing engine should use a versioned configuration so a bill can later be reproduced using the exact tariff that applied.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 637 0 R
/Prev 648 0 R
>>
